wami","abstract":[{"text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s ","type":"text"},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"title":"Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/onDisappear(perform:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/ondisappear(perform:)","type":"topic","abstract":[],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"onDisappear(perform:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"onDisappear","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"perform","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida"},{"text":")?) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/onDisappear(perform:)"}}}